# Named arg type checking: wrong type emits type-checker warning
# Multi-document form ensures $f is fully resolved before check_call inspects it.
# The type checker warns about the named-arg type mismatch (CALL-MONO path).
[f: [fn [x@Int y@Int] [call $+ $x $y]]]
---
[result: [call $f 42 y: "not an int"]]
=== warn
named argument 'y' type mismatch
=== error
[E002] undefined variable: f
